OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FCloudy start, with outbreaks
OL,6,Fof rain sinking south across Wales
OL,7,Fduring the morning. Turning drier and
OL,8,Fbrighter into the afternoon with sunny
OL,9,Fspells and showers, mostly in the west.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,12,FChangeable over the next few days and
OL,13,Ffeeling fresher. Sunshine and showers
OL,14,Fwill spread across the region, and it
OL,15,Fwill turn increasingly windy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
